# Line endings: the repository stores LF, and the working tree gets LF on every
# platform. Everything here is built and run on Linux (Sailfish SDK, OBS) or
# rewritten by Linux tools that only ever emit LF - lupdate regenerates the .ts
# files on every build, Weblate commits them, the spec and the systemd units are
# read by rpm and systemd. Without this file a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF, those tools write LF back, and the files show up
# as modified with an empty diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let any conversion near these.
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
rclone-binaries/* binary
